msgstr "Eliminar proyecto"

#: templates/project_settings.html:176
msgid ""
"Are you absolutely sure you want to delete this project? This cannot be "
"undone."
msgstr ""
"¿Estás absolutamente seguro de que quieres eliminar este proyecto? Esto "
"no se puede deshacer."

